    "Model entries use LiteLLM model_prices_and_context_window.json field names: prices are per token in `currency` (USD unless stated). `litellm_key` names the LiteLLM entry used to cross-check the entry (`--litellm`).",
    "Sovereignty fields are set per provider and copied onto each of its models; a model entry may override them. null means unknown or not verified, and policies must treat it as non-compliant. `us_cloud_act_exposure` reflects the provider's ownership and hosting, not a legal opinion. `zdr` is true only when prompts and outputs are not retained by default; ZDR available on request is false with a note. `certifications` lists company-level certifications, whose scope may not cover the inference service."
